    "size_range_selects_an_encoding": {
      "what": "MINELEN 8 and MAXELEN 0x7fff are NOT a dimension gate. scanline_write (radiance.c:955-978) falls back to a flat, unencoded write outside 8..=32767 and run-length encodes inside it. Both widths below save successfully.",
